"""A mostly lexical work/play/learning signal, with weaker everyday-activity cues.

Responses depend on the word's form. The previous token separates technical
phrases (machine learning, current working directory) from ordinary activities
and strengthens digital/online leisure. Industrial/hardware words are weakly
negative; a small tool-delimiter response is separate. Unlisted words are near
zero around a slightly negative background; this is not a semantic parser.
